cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "balletcomcop: a kinematics-only, force-plate-free implementation of the COM-to-COP inclination-angle balance metric"
abstract: >-
  balletcomcop computes the centre-of-mass to centre-of-pressure inclination angle (IA) and its
  rate of change (RCIA) from kinematics alone, reproducing the Lu-lab balance metric and reusing the
  force-plate-free single-leg COP proxy of Lin et al. (2019). It ships a force-plate validation of the
  proxy and a candid, quantified limitations document.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Yu-Hsin"
    family-names: "Chang"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hsinnearth7/ballet-com-cop-analyzer"
date-released: "2026-08-30"
keywords:
  - biomechanics
  - balance
  - centre of pressure
  - inclination angle
  - markerless
  - motion capture
references:
